You have an Azure subscription named Sub1. Sub1 contains a Microsoft Sentinel workspace named SW1 and a virtual machine named VM1 that runs Windows Server. SW1 gathers security logs from VM1 by using the Windows Security Events via AMA connector.  

You need to restrict the scope of events collected from VM1. The solution must ensure that only audit failure events are collected.  

How should you complete the connector filter expression?

<Dropdown
